  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Meteorite! We've managed to push the Yeti Squadron back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "I seem to have underestimated you, Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "Perhaps I held back a bit too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "(I can't feel my fingers anymore... Damn it...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...What's going on...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "The cold current... is still gathering around her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "This time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "You won't be so lucky."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...? !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Oh no...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Is she trying to absorb all the ice surrounding us and release it at once? !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "——♩——♬——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...She's going to drain all the heat from our bodies!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "These Arts are on a complete different scale from what we saw before...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "Let it all come to an end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "May your anger be buried by purest frost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...Nnngh...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "...♩..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "...?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "Something... is stopping the cold from gathering..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "...Gah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "Is this your doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Didn't I already tell you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "I won't let you... come any closer...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "...Did you disrupt my cold current using your own Arts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "...What a good kid."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Frostleaf used her blade to sever the cold current...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But, but... she can't hold out long in that condition!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Her blade... it's about to break!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...That's more than enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "This is our last chance!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Amiya... now is the time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Cover me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Be careful!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Roger!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Starting firing - suppress Reunion's movements!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Meteorite, go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "On my way...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?! The enemy is... rushing towards us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, she's... she's going straight towards FrostNova?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As if we'd let you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Agh...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Meteorite!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Don't worry, it wasn't a direct hit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She, she's still able to run?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Damn it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I told you! You'll never reach the Yetis!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Keep firing! Don't give her an opening!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...Oh no!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Gaah...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Nooo!! She... she was hit... It can't be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...It's just a scratch! You'll have to do better than that if you want to stop me!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "More... I need to do more..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "(The flow of the cold air... fluctuated for a moment?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Wait... Where is that flow coming from..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "--!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I know this feeling...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Could it be...?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I'll just have to give this a try!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I have to hit it...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Everyone, believe in me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Rhodes Island's leader..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "She shattered the Originium we planted with her Arts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "It's getting hazy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I knew it! FrostNova created that cold current by planting Originium!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Meteorite!! Now's your chance!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Frostleaf..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "I... I promise to save you!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "So, wait for me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Please wait for me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wake up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Nnh...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've got you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Who..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Up here! Quick! Hold on to me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Meteo...rite?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Who said you could play the hero?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Do you think I could just sit there and watch you die?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Put me down... I'm not... some pet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "I won't let go of you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Amiya! Jessica!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "...All right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Everyone, let's get out of here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Meteorite, go ahead with Frostleaf. I'll cover your retreat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Understood!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "...Gah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Haah... Haah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Frostleaf... hang in there...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Don't die... don't you dare die on me!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Don't worry... you can't get rid of me that easily..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Jeez, both you and Amiya too! Why do both of you have to be like this?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "No matter how strong you might be... you're both just kids after all!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "You're still treating me like a kid...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "...If I could save all of you by giving up my life, I think that's a pretty good deal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "You... Mark my words! If you ever try to do something like this again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "If you ever... I'd..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "*sigh*... Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Start running, Meteorite."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Don't... look back...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Hurry! Just go!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Evacuate this area immediately! Protect the medics and the injured!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Snipers...! Aim at those effigies. Keep firing!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Disrupt their formation! Demolish the entire building to cover our escape!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "The explosions are making the haze thicker...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Here's our opening! Get moving!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Everyone, we're retreating from this square!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "So... they got away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "*cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "*cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "How long have you been watching?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Just a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "These warriors are worthy of praise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "Tch."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Be careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Your body isn't in very good condition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "...I don't need you to remind me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "Just do what you need to do, old timer."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "I'm going to go after Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "We have to get rid of them first. Only then, will we be able..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "...to go to Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Phew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Haah......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We're almost at the escape point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor, we..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...Amiya!! We've finally gotten through to the L.G.D.!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "It's an emergency communication!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Listen... up..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en? Can you hear me clearly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...Lungmen..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...What's going on?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...I'm safe now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...Reunion took over one of our important facilities and is now forcefully opening a passage between the slums and the outer city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Amiya..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Lungmen... is in danger."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W managed to lure Lungmen and Rhodes Island right into our trap."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right. They won't be able to escape. Faust and Crownslayer have already broken their defenses at one location."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As you said, this will be our opening to flood into Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We will set up ambushes around every corner. The road to Lungmen will run red with fresh blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right, that old flag-waver should be coming back to Chernobog soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our victory is assured."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you have any other orders for me, Talulah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The time is upon us..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...to turn this rotten city into ashes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
